From: Joshua Beretta <joshuaberetta@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:58:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(subsequences): transcribe with a local
 OpenAI-compatible speech-to-text server

With NLP_BACKEND=local, automatic transcription uses
LocalTranscriptionService instead of Google: same process_data() interface
and attachment error messages, posting the transcoded audio to
LOCAL_WHISPER_URL (/v1/audio/transcriptions, e.g. whisper.cpp's
whisper-server). Like translation, it only runs in a Celery worker.

The local client now covers both servers (LocalServiceError) and owns the
worker check, must_defer_to_worker().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
